### Redirige al login de Microsoft
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/microsoft

### Callback de Microsoft OAuth
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/microsoft/callback

### Registro público (sin auth)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@uniempresarial.edu.co",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "roleId": 2,
  "programId": 1
}

### Usuario de la sesión actual
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### USUARIOS (Admin)
### ============================================

### Listar todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:4000/api/usersAuthorization
Authorization Bearer {{token}}

### Crear usuario (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "Gómez",
  "email": "maria.gomez@uniempresarial.edu.co",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "roleId": 2,
  "programId": 1,
  "department": "Sistemas"
}

### Buscar usuarios
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users?search=sara&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar perfil propio
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/2/department
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department": "Sistemas"
}

### Desactivar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/2/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/2/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar departamento
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/3/department
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department": "Recursos Humanos"
}

### Actualizar permisos
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permissions": { "canEdit": true }
}

### Restablecer contraseña
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/1/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "NuevaPassword123!"
}

### ============================================
### ROLES (Admin)
### ============================================

### Listar roles
GET http://localhost:4000/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear rol
POST http://localhost:4000/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "supervisor"
}

### Renombrar rol
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "administrador"
}

### Eliminar rol
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar rol a usuario
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": 1
}

### ============================================
### EJERCICIOS
### ============================================

### Listar ejercicios
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exercises?search=cuello&categoryId=1&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener ejercicio por ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear ejercicio (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estiramiento de cuello",
  "description": "Estiramiento suave para el cuello",
  "durationSeconds": 120,
  "resourceUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/video.mp4",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Actualizar ejercicio (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estiramiento de cuello actualizado",
  "durationSeconds": 150
}

### Eliminar ejercicio (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### CATEGORÍAS DE EJERCICIO
### ============================================

### Listar categorías
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exercise-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exercise-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuello y hombros"
}

### Actualizar categoría (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/exercise-categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuello y hombros actualizado"
}

### Eliminar categoría (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/exercise-categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### RUTINAS
### ============================================

### Listar rutinas
GET http://localhost:4000/api/routines?search=cuello&routineTypeId=1&active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener rutina por ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/routines/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial del usuario actual
GET http://localhost:4000/api/routines/history/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear rutina (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rutina de cuello",
  "description": "Rutina para aliviar la tensión del cuello",
  "routineTypeId": 1,
  "exercises": [
    { "exerciseId": 1, "orderIndex": 1, "sets": 3, "reps": 10, "restSeconds": 30 }
  ]
}

### Actualizar rutina (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/routines/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rutina de cuello actualizada"
}

### Eliminar rutina (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/routines/1?confirm=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar ejecución de rutina
POST http://localhost:4000/api/routines/1/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completionPercentage": 100,
  "status": "completada",
  "durationSeconds": 300
}

### ============================================
### TIPOS DE RUTINA
### ============================================

### Listar tipos de rutina
GET http://localhost:4000/api/routine-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear tipo de rutina (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/routine-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estiramientos",
  "description": "Rutinas de estiramiento"
}

### Actualizar tipo de rutina (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/routine-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estiramientos actualizados"
}

### Eliminar tipo de rutina (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/routine-types/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### INSIGNIAS
### ============================================

### Listar insignias
GET http://localhost:4000/api/badges?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener insignia por ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear insignia (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/badges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Primera pausa",
  "description": "Completó su primera pausa activa",
  "condition": "pausas_completadas",
  "targetValue": 1
}

### Actualizar insignia (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Primera pausa actualizada"
}

### Eliminar insignia (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### INSIGNIAS DE USUARIO (UserBadge)
### ============================================

### Insignias de un usuario
GET http://localhost:4000/api/user-badges/user/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar insignia a usuario (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/user-badges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "badgeId": 1,
  "progress": 100
}

### Remover insignia de usuario (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/user-badges/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### AUDITORÍA (Admin)
### ============================================

### Listar auditoría
GET http://localhost:4000/api/audits?userId=1&entity=badges&action=CREATE&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener registro de auditoría por ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/audits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### ESTADÍSTICAS AVANZADAS (Admin)
### ============================================

### Obtener estadísticas avanzadas
GET http://localhost:4000/api/stats/advanced
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### NOTIFICACIONES
### ============================================

### Crear notificación (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Recordatorio de rutina",
  "description": "Es hora de tu rutina de ejercicios",
  "routineId": 1,
  "notificationTime": "08:00",
  "reminder": true,
  "reminderMinutes": 10,
  "isActive": true,
  "days": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### Listar todas las notificaciones (Admin)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener notificación por ID (Admin)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar notificación (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Recordatorio actualizado",
  "notificationTime": "09:00",
  "days": [1, 3, 5]
}

### Activar/Desactivar notificación (Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/1/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}2

### Mis notificaciones (usuario autenticado)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/my-notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
